-- Brands 14-16 and items 1001-1020 for CAT-1 (the default catalog uses brands 1-13, items 1-101).
-- 1001: the target item; sorts first in its brand, so a missing self exclusion would show
-- 1003: out of stock, must still be returned
-- 1007: lowercase name, sorts last under ordinal order (would sort early case-insensitively)
-- 1011-1013: another brand, must never appear among Brand Alpha's mates
-- 1020: the only item of its brand
